        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: New York State Route 308, Dutchess County Fairgrounds, Landsman Kill, Rock City, Milan, Red Hook, Rhinebeck\n- Concepts: kill (body of water)\n- Roads: New York State Route 199, New York State Route 308\n\nFacts:\n- A kill is a creek as a type of body of water.\n- New York State Route 308 passes near the Dutchess County Fairgrounds, several historical landmarks, and the Landsman Kill.\n- Rock City, New York, is located at the intersection of New York State Route 199 and New York State Route 308.\n- Rock City, New York, is at the meeting point of the towns of Milan, Red Hook, and Rhinebeck.",
